{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1380234-princess-the-hopeful-fanmade-merits","id":1380234,"title":"Princess: The Hopeful fanmade Merits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-10T16:32:27-07:00","id":1380234,"title":"Princess: The Hopeful fanmade Merits","content":"Over in the Princess the Hopeful Night Horror thread there was one post about an idea for a new Merit for the Princess: The Hopeful game. I pointed out that it didn't really fit on that thread (though the idea itself was pretty good).<br /> I then realized that there wasn't really anywhere for ideas for new Princess Merits to be posted. In fact, there's a depressing lack of threads in comparison with the gameline's apparent popularity.<br /> So, here's somewhere for people to post new Merits &amp; ideas for Merits for the Princess: The Hopeful game. Go nuts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-10T16:33:44-07:00","id":1380235,"title":"","content":"Now that I've got the intro out of the way, the five Merit ideas that I've come up with: <br /> <br /> Darkness-Devourer: You have a deep, dark hunger for the energies given off by the Darkness. You can readily consume these energies thus killing darkspawn, saving Darkened from damnation, cleansing tainted places, &amp; rendering Mnemosyne &amp; Cataphractoi just really dark humans.<br /> Drawback: You yourself are not immune to the taint of the Darkness &amp; engaging in this hunger without being careful can turn you into just another servant of the Darkness.<br /> <br /> Dim the Light: Your very presence weakens the Light of Nobles, Sworn, &amp; Beacons. You cannot turn this on &amp; off.<br /> Drawback: This makes you useful to the Darkness &amp; considered a threat by the Nobles &amp; their allies. Of course, you might not see this as a drawback.<br /> <br /> Immune to the Darkness: For better or worse the Darkness cannot get a hold of you. Nothing it tries will ever change this.<br /> Drawback: Seeing as how the Darkness cannot get you on its side, what's the point of keeping you alive? Expect to be attacked by the Darkness &amp; its servants a lot.<br /> <br /> Memories of the Kingdom: You experience flashes of the Kingdom from before it fell. Brief memories of random people that lived in that time. For better or worse, they are completely accurate.<br /> <br /> Touched by Darkness: You can wield a single Umbrae without being darkspawn. How you come to this power may vary, but the point is you have &amp; no one can take it from you.<br /> Drawback: Use of the Umbrae strengthens any hold the Darkness may have on you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26055,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","user":"Krat05","date":".  Grammer 05-03-2020, 06:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-10T17:16:07-07:00","id":1380244,"title":"","content":"Hmmn how about a Merit for a Legal minor that gives them a proxy or Stand in who can do things for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" 