,"signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T01:51:11-07:00","id":1380601,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13313_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13313\" data-vbnamecard=\"13313\">Sith_Happens</a> I agree. Any of those would work, though I think True Friend would be the best choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T16:53:22-07:00","id":1385679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1380234-princess-the-hopeful-fanmade-merits?p=1380235#post1380235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Darkness-Devourer: You have a deep, dark hunger for the energies given off by the Darkness. You can readily consume these energies thus killing darkspawn, saving Darkened from damnation, cleansing tainted places, &amp; rendering Mnemosyne &amp; Cataphractoi just really dark humans.<br /> Drawback: You yourself are not immune to the taint of the Darkness &amp; engaging in this hunger without being careful can turn you into just another servant of the Darkness.<br /> <br /> Immune to the Darkness: For better or worse the Darkness cannot get a hold of you. Nothing it tries will ever change this.<br /> Drawback: Seeing as how the Darkness cannot get you on its side, what's the point of keeping you alive? Expect to be attacked by the Darkness &amp; its servants a lot.</div> </div> </div> </div>For some reason after reading these merits, I'm imagining a group of humans similar(-ish) to <a href=\"https://euw.leagueoflegends.com/en-gb/champions/tahm-kench/\" target=\"_blank\">Tahm</a> <a href=\"https://leagueoflegends.fandom.com/wiki/Tahm_Kench\" target=\"_blank\">Kench</a> who travel around killing, cooking and eating the flesh of Darkspawn to 'savour' their tastes. Each member prefers a particular variety of Darkspawn (excluding Darkened, whom they see merely as being mislead humans), prioritizing them when possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T17:22:00-07:00","id":1385689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1380234-princess-the-hopeful-fanmade-merits?p=1385679#post1385679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For some reason after reading these merits, I'm imagining a group of humans similar(-ish) to <a href=\"http://&quot;https://euw.leagueoflegends.com/en-gb/champions/tahm-kench/&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Tahm</a> <a href=\"http://&quot;https://leagueoflegends.fandom.com/wiki/Tahm_Kench&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Kench</a> who travel around killing, cooking and eating the flesh of Darkspawn to 'savour' their tastes. Each member prefers a particular variety of Darkspawn (excluding Darkened, whom they see merely as being mislead humans), prioritizing them when possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>One thing about these two Merits is that a character cannot have both of them at the same time, for the simple fact that Immune to the Darkness negates the drawback of Darkness-Devourer. But If you can come up with an alternative drawback then I have no objections to this.<br /> <br /> Second thing that comes to mind is: what might a group of Nobles think upon encountering this unsettling group of humans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T19:06:07-07:00","id":1385706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1380234-princess-the-hopeful-fanmade-merits?p=1385689#post1385689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing about these two Merits is that a character cannot have both of them at the same time, for the simple fact that Immune to the Darkness negates the drawback of Darkness-Devourer. But If you can come up with an alternative drawback then I have no objections to this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree. Can't think of one right now, but maybe to do with Vices?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1380234-princess-the-hopeful-fanmade-merits?p=1385689#post1385689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Second thing that comes to mind is: what might a group of Nobles think upon encountering this unsettling group of humans?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most likely a great deal of WTF?!?!ing on the Noble's part, at least initially, then interest in their capabilities and goals. And also an interest in directing the group towards particularly 'well-developed' Tainted Places (such as Meditech Universal on page 283 of the Dream Version Corebook). Win-win, if you ask the group. They get absolutely ravishing Banquets and the Hopeful are rid of particularly troubling Tainted Places.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}